TOSS Terminal
A modified fork of Terax (https://github.com/crynta/terax-ai) by crynta,
licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications (2026), first released as "Terax Tiling" and renamed TOSS
Terminal: tuios-style tiling for terminal tabs, adapted from the ideas of
tuios (https://github.com/Gaurav-Gosain/tuios): BSP placement, a windowed look
with gaps and title bars, animations and a Ctrl+B keyboard layer; Spaces and
an agents list; a translucent theme; a message line; keybinding presets;
local dictation with whisper.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp,
MIT) and OpenAI Whisper models (MIT); and removal of the built-in AI
assistant. Files changed from upstream carry a "Modified for TOSS Terminal"
note. Original copyright notices are kept.
